Installing Êxodus
=================

APK
---
Download Exodus.apk from GitHub Releases and install on Android
(allow unknown sources if prompted).

From source
-----------
    # JDK 17 + Android SDK
    ./gradlew assembleDebug

APK output: app/build/outputs/apk/debug/app-debug.apk
Create local.properties with sdk.dir=... (not committed).
